				<li>
					<id>1</id>
					<name>Stanislav's Heat Wave</name>
					<appearanceTick>629000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>639309</acceptanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>107278</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Success</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>640457</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>A 32-year-old civil servant named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Stanislav Reynolds&lt;/color&gt; is calling for help! He is hiding from a malfunctioning climate control satellite. He wants to flee and join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Colony&lt;/color&gt;.

If he joins you, an intense heat wave will last for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;7.7 days&lt;/color&gt; until the satellite resets.

Desperate to stay hidden, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Stanislav&lt;/color&gt; claims to be unable to tell you more about himself.</description>
					<root>ThreatReward_GameCondition_Joiner</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<charity>True</charity>
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>2</id>
					<name>RefugeePodCrash</name>
					<appearanceTick>775000</appearanceTick>
