					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gray Trosol&lt;/color&gt;, Spirit Chief of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Lousa Nation&lt;/color&gt;, recently rescued 2 tribespeople from an enemy jail. He wants you to guard them at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; until he can send a shuttle to collect them in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;9 days&lt;/color&gt;. 

