					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt;, Ethical Chair of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Erera&lt;/color&gt;, has discovered an ancient complex a long distance away. She believes it contains information about the relic known as &lt;color=#D9D9BFFF&gt;Axe of Promises&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt; can't spare people to look into it, but hopes you can help by supplying exactly 5 colonists to carry out the investigation.

The complex contains unknown threats and is also being sought by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt;'s enemies, &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Burning Unit&lt;/color&gt;.

She will send a shuttle to pick up your colonists, bring them to the complex, and take them home afterward. They will be fed and tended to en-route.

Once you have landed, you must hack all terminals in the complex within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;2.8 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
					<root>AncientComplex_Mission</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts>
						<li Class="QuestPart_PassAllActivable">
							<inSignalEnable>Quest79.Initiate</inSignalEnable>
							<outSignalsCompleted>
								<li>Quest79.AllTerminalsHacked</li>
							</outSignalsCompleted>
							<inSignals>
								<li>Quest79.terminal0.Hacked</li>
								<li>Quest79.terminal1.Hacked</li>
								<li>Quest79.terminal2.Hacked</li>
							</inSignals>
							<signalsReceived />
							<outSignalAny>Quest79.TerminalHacked</outSignalAny>
							<expiryInfoPartKey>TerminalsHacked</expiryInfoPartKey>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_Message">
							<inSignal>Quest79.TerminalHacked</inSignal>
							<message>Terminal hacked. {COUNT} / 3 complete.</message>
							<messageType>NeutralEvent</messageType>
							<lookTargets IsNull="True" />
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_RandomRaid">
							<inSignal>Quest79.AllTerminalsHacked</inSignal>
							<mapParent>WorldObject_250</mapParent>
							<pointsRange>124.1436~151.731</pointsRange>
							<faction>Faction_9</faction>
							<arrivalMode>EdgeWalkIn</arrivalMode>
							<raidStrategy>ImmediateAttack</raidStrategy>
							<attackTargets />
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_Message">
							<inSignal>Quest79.AllTerminalsHacked</inSignal>
							<message>You've discovered secret information about Axe of Promises! Get back on the shuttle to launch it.</message>
							<messageType>PositiveEvent</messageType>
							<lookTargets>
								<targets>
									<li>Thing_Shuttle1242022</li>
								</targets>
							</lookTargets>
							<getLookTargetsFromSignal>False</getLookTargetsFromSignal>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_SetupTransportShip">
							<inSignal>Quest79.Initiate</inSignal>
							<transportShip>TransportShip_8</transportShip>
							<items IsNull="True" />
							<pawns />
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_SendTransportShipAwayOnCleanup">
							<unloadContents>True</unloadContents>
							<transportShip>TransportShip_8</transportShip>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_PassWhileActive">
							<inSignalEnable>Quest79.Initiate</inSignalEnable>
							<inSignalDisable>Quest79.SendShuttleAway</inSignalDisable>
							<inSignal>Quest79.shuttle.ThingAdded</inSignal>
							<outSignal>Quest79.ShipThingAdded</outSignal>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_Filter_AllRequiredThingsLoaded">
							<inSignal>Quest79.ShipThingAdded</inSignal>
							<outSignal>Quest79.RequiredThingsLoaded</outSignal>
							<shuttle>Thing_Shuttle1242022</shuttle>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_Filter_AnyOnTransporterCapableOfHacking">
							<inSignal>Quest79.RequiredThingsLoaded</inSignal>
							<outSignal>Quest79.SendShuttleAway</outSignal>
							<outSignalElse>Quest79.CheckShuttleContents</outSignalElse>
							<transporter>Thing_Shuttle1242022</transporter>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_Dialog">
							<inSignal>Quest79.CheckShuttleContents</inSignal>
							<text>The shuttle for the quest 'Hidden Construction Examination' has no passenger capable of hacking. You must send at least one person capable of hacking to investigate the ancient complex.</text>
							<title>Passengers incapable of hacking.</title>
							<options>
