				<li>
					<id>124</id>
					<name>Akakios's Mech Cluster</name>
					<appearanceTick>19313000</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>0</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>19582455</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Akakios&lt;/color&gt;, a freeholder of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt;, is making a request. A mechanoid swarm has been attacking his settlements. He wants you to signal the mechs to distract them while he clears the hive. If you do, (*Threat)a mechanoid cluster(/Threat) will land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt;.

The pods contain these dangers:

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 centipede burner&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 militors&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 pikeman&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 auto mortar&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 proximity activator&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 unstable power cell&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;4 mech nodes&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 mech drop beacon&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 mech capsule&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 mini-slugger turrets&lt;/color&gt;

The mechanoid cluster will be initially dormant. It may have a countdown activator, or it may stay dormant forever until disturbed.</description>
