						<memberName>Torturist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Full Boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Full Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"I looked at this mega-corp CEO, with his pitiful rent-a-cops, all that power left fallow. I tried to convince him that you never really know yourself until you've screamed in the pits of hell. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - &lt;i&gt;Nocic Theft&lt;/i&gt; by Leila 'Parks' Clark</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"I looked at this mega-corp CEO, with his pitiful rent-a-cops, all that power left fallow. I tried to convince him that you never really know yourself until you've screamed in the pits of hell. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - &lt;i&gt;Nocic Theft&lt;/i&gt; by Leila 'Parks' Clark</descriptionTemplate>
